# ==============================================================================
# RESEND EMAIL SERVICE CONFIGURATION FOR K. V. PRADEEPTHI'S PORTFOLIO
# ==============================================================================
# 
# 1. OBTAINING A RESEND API KEY:
#    - Navigate to https://resend.com and create a free account.
#    - Use your receiving email (deepthikamichetty336@gmail.com) for initial testing.
#    - Go to https://resend.com/api-keys and click "Create API Key".
#    - Copy your key (starts with 're_') and paste it below.
#
# 2. SENDER ADDRESS & DOMAIN VERIFICATION:
#    - Testing Mode:
#      Resend provides a default testing domain: "onboarding@resend.dev".
#      NOTE: When using "onboarding@resend.dev", Resend ONLY delivers emails to the
#      email address associated with your Resend account (deepthikamichetty336@gmail.com).
#      Set: SENDER_EMAIL=Portfolio Contact <onboarding@resend.dev>
#
#    - Production Mode (Custom Domain):
#      To send from your own branded domain (e.g., contact@pradeepthi.dev):
#      - Add your domain at https://resend.com/domains
#      - Configure the DKIM and SPF DNS records in your DNS provider.
#      - Once Resend marks the domain as "Verified", set:
#        SENDER_EMAIL=K. V. Pradeepthi <contact@yourdomain.com>
#
# ==============================================================================

RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_api_key_here
SENDER_EMAIL=Portfolio Contact <onboarding@resend.dev>
RECIPIENT_EMAIL=deepthikamichetty336@gmail.com
